<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - MIM Corp started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - MIM Corp started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber started coverage of MIM Corp as attractive, a PaineWebber source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock slipped 1/4 to 11-3/4.</p>
<p>-- The analyst set share earnings estimates of $0.28 for 1996, $0.90 for 1997, and a range of $1.25-1.40 for 1998.</p>
</text>
